OL,3,GNEWSASwinney to cut number of mainland
OL,4,Ahealth boards from 11 to two
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to cut the number of health
OL,7,Fboards providing local services across
OL,8,FScotland are to be set out at Holyrood
OL,9,Fthis afternoon.
OL,11,FThe BBC understands the number of
OL,12,Fterritorial boards serving mainland
OL,13,FScotland are to be reduced from 11 to
OL,14,Ftwo.
OL,16,FExisting boards could be merged so that
OL,17,Fthere would be one for the west and
OL,18,Fanother for the east of Scotland.
OL,20,FSeparate plans are being considered for
OL,21,Fthe three island groups - Shetland,
OL,22,FOrkney, and the Western Isles.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
